DATA (data/flyby_data.csv, data/DATA_DICTIONARY.txt): CC-BY-4.0
================================================================================

The compiled dataset in data/ -- a machine-readable transcription and
re-derivation of values from the published sources cited in
DATA_DICTIONARY.txt -- is made available under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt this compiled dataset for any purpose,
provided you give appropriate credit to this repository AND to the
original primary sources listed in DATA_DICTIONARY.txt (principally
Anderson et al. 2008, Physical Review Letters 100, 091102), since this
file is a derived compilation, not original observational data.

